transmission. No Linux source is linked or vendored.

WPA2 CCMP key commands and RX replay interpretation follow the same pinned iwx
reference (65596250e06438442ce07bad87e5ba129229607d), including SEC_KEY v1 and
ADD_STA_KEY v2 layouts and CCMP receive status/IV handling. The actual pinned
CC77 image advertises SEC_KEY v1 and ADD_STA_KEY v3; Pyxis selects the former
checked 80-byte profile. Pyxis owns capability/lifetime/controlled-port policy;
no new cryptographic primitive is implemented here.

